195	  // MARK: Aggregation
196	
197	  /// Mirror the *combined* unread count across all windows onto the menu-bar label + Dock badge
198	  /// (issue #70). Replaces the per-store `DockBadge.apply` so a second window can't clobber the
199	  /// first's count. Called from each store's `notifications.onTotalChange` and on register/unregister.
200	  func recomputeBadge() {
